  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Federated States of Micronesia (FSM) Partnership for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s bilateral aid program to the Federated States of Micronesia focuses on the following three strategic objectives:

1.  Improving the educational system, through better assessment of student learning, strengthened teacher training, improved learning materials and greater community engagement.  

2. Support for greater gender equity and the rights of women and children through fostering legislative and regulatory changes and support for women&#x2019;s economic empowerment.

3. Increased resilience to natural hazards through completion of the Climate Adaptation and Disaster Risk Reduction Education project and through support for community projects that focus on climate adaptation, resilience, and disaster preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
